\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {8}{\ignorespaces Accuracy of the one-dimensional homogeneous reduction. Curves should be evaluated over the full 0--5000~s interval, not only at the final time. \par \vspace  \smallskipamount \textit  {Figure source: Network curves are in \texttt  {co2\_adsorption\_campaign\_finite\_inlet\_5000s/seed\_*/timeseries.csv}. Homogeneous curves and fit comparisons are in \texttt  {co2\_homogeneous\_campaign\_100cells/seed\_*/timeseries.csv} and \texttt  {fit\_comparison.csv}; campaign parameters are in \texttt  {co2\_homogeneous\_campaign\_100cells/homogeneous\_campaign\_summary.csv}.}}}{8}{figure.8}\protected@file@percent }
